OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers this evening will gradually
OL,7,Fbecome more isolated overnight with
OL,8,Fsome long clear spells developing.
OL,9,FFeeling rather chilly with
OL,10,Foccasionally fresh northwesterly winds
OL,11,Feasing.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA few early showers,
OL,14,Fotherwise dry with some good spells of
OL,15,Fsunshine. Cloud increasing later with
OL,16,Frain reaching Orkney by evening and
OL,17,FShetland by midnight. Freshening winds
OL,18,Fthrough the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
