OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FOvernight
OL,6,Fheavy rain soon clearing then sunny
OL,7,Fspells and blustery showers Friday,
OL,8,Fthe showers becoming heavier, more
OL,9,Ffrequent Saturday, with northwesterly
OL,10,Fgales for Orkney. Mainly dry and
OL,11,Fbright Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
